  "phrases": [
    {
      "id": "hook",
      "text": "Those tiny dashed lines on the highway are much bigger than your brain thinks.",
      "start": 0.04,
      "end": 3.918,
      "wordRange": [
        0,
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ten-feet",
      "text": "In the United States, a standard broken lane marking is typically about 10 feet long,",
      "start": 4.214,
      "end": 8.803,
      "wordRange": [
        14,
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-gap",
      "text": "and the gap after it is around 30 feet.",
      "start": 9.095,
      "end": 11.132,
      "wordRange": [
        29,
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "perspective",
      "text": "But from inside a moving car, perspective makes them look like tiny little strips of paint.",
      "start": 11.407,
      "end": 15.819,
      "wordRange": [
        38,
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bill-scale",
      "text": "10 feet is about 3 meters, so if Bill stood next to one of those little road lines, the line would absolutely destroy him in a height comparison.",
      "start": 16.138,
      "end": 23.654,
      "wordRange": [
        54,
        81
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "payoff",
      "text": "Your brain has basically been shrinking the road underneath you this entire time.",
      "start": 23.998,
      "end": 27.535,
      "wordRange": [
        82,
        94
      ]
    }
  ],
